{"id":"tela","lemma":"tela","pos":"noun","rank":3422,"glosses":["cloth, fabric (woven material made of fibers)","difficult task (difficult or tedious undertaking, especially as part of one's duties)","cash, dosh (money)"],"ipa":"/ˈtela/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"telas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tela.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta tela parece terciopelo.","en":"This cloth feels like velvet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306325","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"velvet"}]},{"text":"¿Es de buena calidad esta tela?","en":"Is this good material?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454217","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},{"g":"quality"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Esa tela es muy áspera.","en":"That cloth is very rough.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"rough","l":"áspero"}]},{"text":"Prefiero las telas lisas.","en":"I prefer plain materials.","words":[{"g":"to prefer","l":"preferir"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"mullet, white mullet","l":"lisa"}]},{"text":"Ellos cubrieron la mesa con una tela.","en":"They covered the table with a cloth.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to cover","l":"cubrir"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"table"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}